---
const phone = '06 27 31 38 70';
const phoneLink = 'tel:+33627313870';
---

<section class="bg-blue-600 py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
      Une urgence ? Un projet ?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-blue-100 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Nos experts sont prêts à intervenir. Contactez-nous dès maintenant pour une réponse immédiate.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a
        href={phoneLink}
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-blue-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-lg transition-colors"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/>
        </svg>
        {phone}
      </a>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-transparent hover:bg-white/10 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-lg border-2 border-white/30 transition-colors"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
        </svg>
        Demander un devis en ligne
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
